                  "elements": [
                    {
                      "id": "e649a21e",
                      "settings": {
                        "ekit_accordion_items": [
                          {
                            "acc_title": "Does a one-day corporate conference need a SCEGA permit?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>A one-day duration does not, by itself, determine the licensing route. We review the programme, organizing entity, venue, participants and accompanying activities to identify the relevant conference requirements.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "yes",
                            "_id": "1f812899"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "Can our company apply directly, or do we need an eligible conference organizer?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>That depends on the service&#x27;s eligibility conditions, the organizing entity and the applicant&#x27;s account and authorization. SYNC reviews the proposed arrangements with you; application support does not replace any requirement for an eligible organizer or authorized applicant.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "e8add888"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "What information should we send SYNC to start?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>Send your organizing entity, conference purpose, draft programme, speakers, proposed venue, dates and expected attendance, plus any sponsor booths or accompanying activities. We review the brief, identify outstanding information and agree the support scope before preparing the file.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "b368ac79"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "What is the difference between local and international conference licensing?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>The applicable classification and government fee depend on the authority&#x27;s criteria and the conference circumstances. Do not assume that one overseas speaker makes the event international; we review the full format and proposed participation before confirming the application route.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "a421f071"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "How much does a conference permit cost, and how long does the service take?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>The listed government fees are SAR 5,000 for local and SAR 10,000 for international conferences, seminars and forums; SYNC&#x27;s professional fees are separate. The published conference service period is five working days, with additional time needed for file preparation or further review; confirm the current category and conditions before payment.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "79c82fcc"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "Can our conference include sponsor booths or an exhibition area?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>Include the booths and exhibition area in the initial brief. We review whether the activities fit the conference scope or require additional approvals; an accompanying display should not automatically be treated as the same application as an independent trade exhibition.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "601f85a1"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "Can a foreign company arrange a conference in Saudi Arabia?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>The available arrangements depend on the company&#x27;s status, the selected service and the eligibility and representation requirements. We review the proposed organizer, applicant and authorizations so the relevant questions are resolved before submission.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "bdc23101"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "Can we promote the conference before the licence is issued?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>Check the applicable SCEGA conditions before announcing, selling access to or promoting your conference. Submitting an application is not permission to proceed with activities that require a licence or promotional approval; we help identify the conditions relevant to your plan.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "1dcd0c2d"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "Can SYNC help with overseas speakers, hotel bookings and visa paperwork?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>Yes. We can agree a separate guest-support scope covering accommodation coordination and visa application information or supporting documents. The event licence and each traveller&#x27;s visa or entry permission are separate processes, and their decisions remain with the relevant authorities.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "372eed2e"
                          },
                          {
                            "acc_title": "What happens if our application is returned or our conference details change?",
                            "acc_content": "<p>A request to complete or correct an application is different from changing a submitted or licensed event. We review the authority&#x27;s feedback or your revised dates, venue and programme, then help coordinate the appropriate response, amendment or cancellation steps.</p>",
                            "ekit_acc_is_active": "",
                            "_id": "683642d7"
                          }
                        ],
